Output docs/public/media/cli-install.mp4
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Padding 30
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Hide
Type "source docs/media-src/demo-env.sh && clear"
Enter
Show
Set PlaybackSpeed 2.5
Type 'omavn install "Dies irae"'
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Wait+Screen@300s /play it:/
Sleep 3s
Type "omavn run dies"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
